# Narrowly scoped to what SDV PostgreSQL account-separation actually needs.
# infra/initdb/*.sh is executed (or sourced) by the official PostgreSQL image's
# entrypoint inside a Linux container; a POSIX shell rejects a CRLF-terminated
# shebang/script. Force LF regardless of core.autocrlf on any checkout.
infra/initdb/*.sh text eol=lf
